@template dry
// One of the ten voice templates (the head writer, with social B). Its words match section 20c's VOICE_FALLBACK, so
// baking it changes nothing; the template's own lines (content/templates/dry.lines) come in wave 2.
talk: Deadpan, quick, understated; teases the people they like.
hi: Oh, it's you | Hey
bye: Off you go | Don't break anything
yes: Fine | Go on then
thanks: Ta | You're all right, you
wow: Well, look at that
sigh: Honestly
nick: - | - | - | trouble | trouble
needs: cheer
